    "title": "Football: Aggies Drop Weekday Clash in Miami - NewsBreak",
    "text": "16 hours ago NM State will take its second bye week of the season, returning to action Oct. 21 against Sam Houston. MIAMI – Playing in its second midweek game of the season, NM State returned to action on Wednesday night, taking on the FIU Panthers as part of Weekday CUSA. Behind a trio of giveaways, the Aggies recorded their lowest scoring output of the season, falling 22-3. With the loss, NM State falls to 2-4 on the season, with a 1-1 mark in Conference USA action. After playing three games in a span of 12 days, NM State now looks ahead to a bye week, before visiting Huntsville, Texas, for a Wednesday night matchup with Sam Houston on Oct. 21. Read full article",
